    "result_text": "All 12 tests pass. \n\nI implemented the `initials` field by:\n\n1. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (so the generated `OwnerDto` gets a field + getter/setter).\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes it as the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot:\n\n```java\n@Mapping(target = \"initials\", expression = \"java(Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\" + Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \\\".\\\")\")\n```\n\nFor input `firstName=john`, `lastName=smith`, this yields `\"J.S.\"`, matching the spec and the `Cp06Tests` expectation. The full suite is green (12/12).",
